                    <p class="eyebrow">Step 2 of 5</p><h2>How will you perform this song?</h2>
                    <p class="muted">Choose a playback configuration. You can change it while this package is a draft.</p>
                    <div class="mode-grid">
                      <button class="mode selected"><strong>Backing + click</strong><span>Backing to PA, click to monitors</span></button>
                      <button class="mode"><strong>Backing only</strong><span>No click or count-in</span></button>
                      <button class="mode"><strong>Click only</strong><span>The band performs everything else</span></button>
                      <button class="mode"><strong>Live only</strong><span>No Engine audio required</span></button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="upload-row"><div><b>Backing track</b><small>take-on-me-backing.wav · 3:46</small></div><button>Replace</button></div>
                    <div class="upload-row"><div><b>Click / count-in</b><small>take-on-me-click.wav · 3:46</small></div><button>Replace</button></div>
                    <div class="timeline"><span>Click</span><div class="wave click"></div><span>Backing</span><div class="wave backing"></div></div>
                    <div class="callout good">✓ Shared timeline detected · 48 kHz · duration aligned</div>
                    <footer><button class="secondary">Back</button><span></span><button class="primary">Save and continue</button></footer>
